com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2781660\/extras\/5340906c0410ede4adae038b6ecc68f8.avif?t=1793197285\" width=1000 height=200 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2781660\/extras\/a88e16a2ab66728019c8c4daa94cea77.poster.avif?t=1793197285\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2781660\/extras\/a88e16a2ab66728019c8c4daa94cea77.webm?t=1793197285\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2781660\/extras\/a88e16a2ab66728019c8c4daa94cea77.mp4?t=1793197285\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every captured isle becomes a foothold for your people. Raise towers, rally warriors, claim strategy resources and build an economy to sustain your defenses against the Empire's forces.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2781660\/extras\/ae938b21b35c4255a4c0075d29214319.avif?t=1793197285\" width=1000 height=200 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2781660\/extras\/d8f6a5fa180b4bc38c5331bfcce88b6f.avif?t=1793197285\" width=1000 height=350 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face Empire warlords who challenge your defenses with unique tactics. With each run, uncover their identity, learn their patterns, and adapt your strategy to claim victory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2781660\/extras\/2fccae5828cfb00ba2a4870890d19f2d.avif?t=1793197285\" width=1000 height=200 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2781660\/extras\/fca62b0f315dc5f6e9baa5f4a74608c6.poster.avif?t=1793197285\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2781660\/extras\/fca62b0f315dc5f6e9baa5f4a74608c6.webm?t=1793197285\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2781660\/extras\/fca62b0f315dc5f6e9baa5f4a74608c6.mp4?t=1793197285\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the powers of ancient runestones and unlock upgrades for towers, warriors and economy, forging new strategies with every battle. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2781660\/extras\/602afab9ae616f0233f537ee6ddbb6c6.avif?t=1793197285\" width=1000 height=200 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battle sharpens your tactics, unlocks new tools, and prepares you for greater challenges ahead. Rise stronger and stand ready to face the Empire’s assault.<\/p>","short_description":"Dawn of Defense blends RTS, Tower Defense, and Roguelite progression. In a last defense, lead your tribe against the Empire: Command warriors in battle, fortify defenses, and build an economy as you fight to reclaim your ancestral homeland.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Polish, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2781660\/d075771dd5638ff48d2214486a183e2ffd0e8ed4\/header.jpg?t=1793197285","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2781660\/0bbfcff763db244e03e13c553e988041afb283da\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793197285","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2781660\/0bbfcff763db244e03e13c553e988041afb283da\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793197285","website":"https:\/\/6side.de\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> TBD<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GTX 1050<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> TBD<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> TBD<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> TBD MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> TBD<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[]}}}